---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import { Image } from "astro:assets";
import headshot from "../assets/about-headshot.png";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About"
  description="Multimedia producer with over a decade of experience in photography, video, and editing for brands like Beyond Meat, World Market, and Clorox."
>
  <section class="container about">
    <div class="about__headshot">
      <Image src={headshot} alt="Abner Soto" width={640} />
    </div>
    <div class="about__copy">
      <h1>About</h1>
      <p>
        I'm a multimedia producer with over a decade of experience helping
        brands turn ideas into finished content — from first concept through
        final delivery. Whether I'm behind the camera as a DP, directing a
        shoot as producer, or in the edit bay cutting the final piece, I
        handle production end-to-end so clients get a polished result
        without managing multiple vendors.
      </p>
      <p>
        I've worked with brands like Beyond Meat, World Market, Raley's,
        Analog Devices, Albertsons, and Clorox, bringing the same level of
        care to a single product shoot as I do to a full commercial
        production. My background spans photography (Capture One,
        Lightroom, Photoshop), video camera operation (cinema, ENG, DSLR),
        and editing (Premiere Pro, DaVinci Resolve, After Effects), so I can
        flex to whatever format a project calls for — stills, video, or
        both.
      </p>
      <p>
        I also bring FAA Remote Pilot certification to the table, so aerial
        footage is part of what I can offer without bringing in an extra
        crew.
      </p>
      <p>
        If you're looking for a producer who can manage the full process —
        concept, production, and post — and deliver content built to
        perform, let's talk.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .about {
    display: grid;
    gap: var(--space-4);
    padding-block: var(--space-5);
  }

  @media (min-width: 768px) {
    .about {
      grid-template-columns: 320px 1fr;
      align-items: start;
    }
  }

  .about__headshot {
    aspect-ratio: 1 / 1;
    overflow: hidden;
    border-radius: 4px;
  }

  .about__headshot :global(img) {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
  }

  .about h1 {
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-2);
  }

  .about__copy p + p {
    margin-top: var(--space-2);
  }
</style>
